-- src:397 | (a) threatens the life or security of a Canadian crew member; or
-- src:398 | (b) is committed on or in relation to, or damages, a flight element provided by Canada.
@ref s 7(2.36) (src:395-398)
DECLARE `s 7(2.36) ground` IS ONE OF
    `s 7(2.36)(a) the act or omission threatens the life or security of a Canadian crew member`
    `s 7(2.36)(b) the act or omission is committed on or in relation to, or damages, a flight element provided by Canada`

@ref s 7(2.36) (src:395-398)
GIVEN `the person is a crew member of a Partner State, by s 7(2.38)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the act or omission is outside Canada during a space flight, by s 7(2.38)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `it is on, or in relation to, a flight element of the Lunar Gateway, on any means of transportation to and from the Lunar Gateway or on the surface of the Moon` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the class of offence the act or omission would be if committed in Canada` IS A `Class of offence`
      grounds IS A LIST OF `s 7(2.36) ground`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 7(2.36) the act or omission is deemed to have been committed in Canada` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the person is a crew member of a Partner State, by s 7(2.38)` EQUALS NOTHING OR `the act or omission is outside Canada during a space flight, by s 7(2.38)` EQUALS NOTHING THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (silent): section 7(2.38) did not answer whether the person is a crew member of a Partner State or the moment is within a space flight
        IF `the person is a crew member of a Partner State, by s 7(2.38)` EQUALS JUST FALSE OR `the act or omission is outside Canada during a space flight, by s 7(2.38)` EQUALS JUST FALSE THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a crew member of a Partner State who commits an act or omission outside Canada during a space flight"
        IF NOT `it is on, or in relation to, a flight element of the Lunar Gateway, on any means of transportation to and from the Lunar Gateway or on the surface of the Moon` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "on, or in relation to, a flight element of the Lunar Gateway, on any means of transportation to and from the Lunar Gateway or on the surface of the Moon"
        IF `the class of offence the act or omission would be if committed in Canada` EQUALS `an offence punishable on summary conviction` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "would constitute an indictable offence"
        IF NOT (null grounds) THEN JUST TRUE
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "is deemed to have committed that act or omission in Canada, if that act or omission"

-- src:399 | Consent of Attorney General of Canada
-- src:400 | (2.37) No proceedings in relation to an offence referred to in subsection (2.35) or (2.36) may be instituted without the consent of the Attorney General of Canada.
@ref s 7(2.37) (src:399-400)
GIVEN `the offence is one referred to in subsection (2.35) or (2.36)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the consent of the Attorney General of Canada has been obtained` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 7(2.37) the proceedings are barred for want of the consent of the Attorney General of Canada` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the offence is one referred to in subsection (2.35) or (2.36)` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "in relation to an offence referred to in subsection (2.35) or (2.36)"
        IF `the consent of the Attorney General of Canada has been obtained` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "without the consent of the Attorney General of Canada"
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE
